WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.423
Search maps in

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:02.272
plain English

00:00:02.790 --> 00:00:03.851
A Show HN

00:00:03.663 --> 00:00:05.172
project offers fast

00:00:05.231 --> 00:00:07.082
deterministic natural-language

00:00:06.894 --> 00:00:08.591
search over OpenStreetMap

00:00:08.403 --> 00:00:08.933
data

00:00:09.181 --> 00:00:10.396
turning plain queries

00:00:10.207 --> 00:00:11.422
into map results

00:00:11.950 --> 00:00:12.810
Type a plain

00:00:12.622 --> 00:00:13.211
query

00:00:13.342 --> 00:00:14.450
like cafes by

00:00:14.261 --> 00:00:16.666
the Limmat 100 metres from the lake

00:00:16.478 --> 00:00:17.209
in Zurich

00:00:17.398 --> 00:00:18.388
and it returns

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:19.402
the matching places

00:00:19.214 --> 00:00:20.016
on the map

00:00:20.534 --> 00:00:21.300
The search is

00:00:21.112 --> 00:00:22.409
deterministic so the

00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:23.600
same query returns

00:00:23.411 --> 00:00:24.472
the same results

00:00:24.390 --> 00:00:25.239
every time

00:00:25.345 --> 00:00:26.536
no ranking roulette

00:00:26.619 --> 00:00:27.644
just the places

00:00:27.456 --> 00:00:28.269
that match

00:00:28.806 --> 00:00:29.820
Full story on

00:00:29.631 --> 00:00:30.527
the dashboard
